menu "Research CSI receiver"

config RESEARCH_RX_ESPNOW_MODE
    bool "Use the external research ESP-NOW transmitter"
    default y
    help
        Keep the CSI source-MAC filter on 1a:00:00:00:00:00 and do not start
        the receiver's legacy router-ping/null-data traffic generator. Disable
        this option to retain the legacy router-triggered CSI workflow.

endmenu
